+```
+
+- `date`: ISO date (`YYYY-MM-DD`).
+- `amount`: decimal with up to two places, e.g. `-45.10`.
+- `currency` (optional): ISO 4217 code of exactly three uppercase ASCII
+  letters, e.g. `EUR`. When the fourth column is missing, the currency is `USD`.
